{"id":"n60633-1-1","stage":1,"title":"글쎄요 · 也许吧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60633-1-1-1","ko":"민준 씨, 내일 저희 모임에 나와 주실 수 있어요?","zh":"敏俊，你明天能来参加我们的聚会吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"모임에","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모임에","audio":"/audio/9b4c76c72e07467e4dae.mp3"}},{"text":"나와","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와","audio":"/audio/3e680d9cb0a070926232.mp3"}},{"text":"주실","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주실","audio":"/audio/00ef51f0814b98d6d743.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec0726a14e5a8512f2f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60633-1-1-2","ko":"글쎄요, 다른 약속이 있기는 한데....","zh":"那个嘛，我还有别的安排……","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"약속이","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속이","audio":"/audio/9bb29fbf6b1cacbf6712.mp3"}},{"text":"있기는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있기는","audio":"/audio/8a06a8de48808799b4f8.mp3"}},{"text":"한데....","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한데","audio":"/audio/3610e67afbd78efa06e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d78d8f8119f058c6928.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.68,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60633","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.6888,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个嘛，我还有别的安排……","这件衬衫的扣子掉了。","敏俊，你明天能来参加我们的聚会吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个嘛，我还有别的安排……","敏俊，你明天能来参加我们的聚会吗？","这件衬衫的扣子掉了。"],"answer":0}]}
